  "note": "Golden set for tests/bench/run-synonym-search-bench.ts. Every subject is a real entity in static/*.ttl and every alias is a name this project genuinely uses for it \u2014 NOT invented to make the benchmark pass. Queries are deliberately HARD: they use the alias and avoid the entity's own label and slug tokens, because a query that leaks the real name measures nothing about synonyms. An earlier, looser set scored 100% hit@10 with expansion OFF and proved only that the corpus is well connected.",
